# Internationalization Implementation Rules

<rule>
name: atlas_i18n
description: Standards for implementing proper internationalization features
filters:
  - type: file_extension
    pattern: "\\.(?:js|jsx|ts|tsx|json)$"
  - type: content
    pattern: "(?i)i18n|internationalization|localization|translation"

actions:
  - type: suggest
    message: |
      When implementing internationalization features:

      ## Translation Management
      - Use proper translation keys
      - Implement proper translation files
      - Use proper namespace organization
      - Implement proper fallback languages
      - Use proper translation tools

      ## Date & Time
      - Use proper date formatting
      - Implement proper timezone handling
      - Use proper calendar systems
      - Implement proper relative time
      - Use proper date parsing

      ## Number Formatting
      - Use proper number formatting
      - Implement proper currency handling
      - Use proper decimal separators
      - Implement proper unit conversion
      - Use proper measurement systems

      ## Text Direction
      - Implement proper RTL support
      - Use proper text alignment
      - Implement proper bidirectional text
      - Use proper layout flipping
      - Implement proper mirroring

      ## Content Management
      - Use proper pluralization
      - Implement proper gender rules
      - Use proper context rules
      - Implement proper interpolation
      - Use proper formatting options

examples:
  - input: "Adding text to the user interface"
    output: "Internationalized content with proper translation keys and namespacing"

metadata:
  priority: high
  version: 1.0
</rule>